note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/runtime/check/cfacts-check.om: the gate's check of gpu/runtime/cfacts.om. Run from the repository root
note with no arguments, it reads the two test inputs listed, with their sha256, in
note gpu/runtime/check/cfacts-fixture.sha256.txt (C text exercising each rule of cfacts.om: comments and literals,
note extern "C", pending regions under #if, #elif, #else, #ifdef, #ifndef, a define standing for a pending flag,
note a define cycle, unknown conditions, a continued directive, calls into Omega and to a device word through
note the same-file and the any-file rule) and gpu/runtime/cudapp-ident.txt and gpu/runtime/devwords.txt, and
note writes the facts; the gate compares them with gpu/runtime/check/cfacts.expect.txt.
text cfx_list "gpu/runtime/check/cfacts-fixture.sha256.txt"
fn main to int
put cf_root 0 46
put cf_n 21 1
for i ulong len cf_dflt
put cf_dir i get cf_dflt i
end
put cf_n 1 len cf_dflt
pclr
pt cfx_list
tload 4
pdir cf_fid
tload 6
pdir cf_fdev
tload 8
cfrun true
ret 0
end
